# Subagent strategy

## Finish this template before enabling it

Replace every `[FILL: ...]` entry and delete this section. Rename this file to
`SKILL.md`, add `subagent-strategy` to the intended profile's `skills_list.txt`,
run `bash ~/dotfiles/ai/sync.sh`, then `/reload` in Pi.
Invoke with `/skill:subagent-strategy <task>`.

## When this strategy applies

- Use subagents when: [FILL: requests or kinds of work that warrant delegation].
